Mavara kana-zvasvika: ['html'] ita: { <- (
		pachako
		tsiva: ['&'] na: ['&amp;'],
		tsiva: ['<'] na: ['&lt;'],
		tsiva: ['>'] na: ['&gt;'],
		tsiva: ['"'] na: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Rondedzero nyowani.

['Verbatim Syntax'] mabhii chimwe-nechimwe: { :nhamba :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (nhamba), Letter: letter).
}.

Zvabuda list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list batanidza: ['↵']).

Zvabuda nyora: template.

